OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after being hit by coach 
OL,4,Aat services                            
OL,6,FA man has died after being hit by a    
OL,7,Fcoach at a motorway service station.   
OL,9,FPolice were called to the M61          
OL,10,Fnorthbound Rivington services near     
OL,11,FChorley, Lancashire, at 14:30 GMT on   
OL,12,FSunday.                                
OL,14,FThe pedestrian, a man in his 50s,      
OL,15,Fsuffered serious injuries when he was  
OL,16,Fhit by the coach in the coach parking  
OL,17,Farea, and was pronounced dead at the   
OL,18,Fscene.                                 
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
