OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after being hit by coach 
OL,4,Aat services                            
OL,6,FThe services, and the northbound entry 
OL,7,Fslip road to them, were closed while   
OL,8,Fofficers investigated, Lancashire      
OL,9,FPolice said.                           
